systerm (0.1.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Broadcast: suppress the fed panes' echo at its source. feed_child()
    makes a pane synchronously re-emit "commit"; we now block each target's
    commit handler across the write so that echo can't re-enter and fan out.
    This no longer depends on focus tracking or a timing-sensitive flag.

 -- Sysible <sysiblesoftware@gmail.com>  Thu, 06 Aug 2026 19:11:55 +0000

systerm (0.1.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix broadcast amplification: one keystroke could fan out repeatedly and
    fill every pane with copies of each character. Only the focused pane's
    input fans out; the fed panes' echoes are ignored.

 -- Sysible <sysiblesoftware@gmail.com>  Thu, 06 Aug 2026 18:54:49 +0000

systerm (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix crash when broadcasting to all panes (feeding each pane re-emitted
    "commit", recursing until the stack overflowed); guard against re-entry.
  * Palette: bright-green slot also set to the logo green so bold prompts match.
  * Package: colour root's shell prompt royal blue on install (marked block in
    /root/.bashrc, removed on uninstall) so root reads on-brand like users.

 -- Sysible <sysiblesoftware@gmail.com>  Thu, 06 Aug 2026 17:02:23 +0000

systerm (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Default palette: green and blue tuned to the Sysible logo (green
    #43a047, royal blue #3560d4) so ANSI green/blue in shell prompts match.

 -- Sysible <sysiblesoftware@gmail.com>  Thu, 06 Aug 2026 14:39:26 +0000

systerm (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix crash when closing a split pane (re-entrant child-exited).
  * Sharper, more professional app icon; ship PNG icons (16-256px).
  * Friendly message when launched without a usable display.

 -- Sysible <sysiblesoftware@gmail.com>  Thu, 06 Aug 2026 02:53:47 +0000

systerm (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

